  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="db3e5236-c2a2-49c7-804d-f43ce4d36a8b"><problem><para>
      <para>The quadratic equation \(x^2+7x+10=0\) is in the form of \(ax^2+bx+c=0\).</para>
      <para>What is the value of \(a\)?</para>
      <para>Enter the value of \(a\).</para>
    </para></problem><solution><para>1</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is 1. The value of \(a\) is 1. </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
